Modified Versions (generated, crates/notyas-fonts/src/gen/)
-----------------------------------------------------------

   notyas Sans Regular 24 px     (sans_regular_24.rs)    from IBMPlexSans-Regular.ttf
   notyas Sans Regular 32 px     (sans_regular_32.rs)    from IBMPlexSans-Regular.ttf
   notyas Sans SemiBold 32 px    (sans_semibold_32.rs)   from IBMPlexSans-SemiBold.ttf
   notyas Sans SemiBold 44 px    (sans_semibold_44.rs)   from IBMPlexSans-SemiBold.ttf
   notyas Mono Regular 28 px     (mono_regular_28.rs)    from IBMPlexMono-Regular.ttf
   notyas Mono Regular 32 px     (mono_regular_32.rs)    from IBMPlexMono-Regular.ttf

   Modification: subset to U+0020-U+007E plus U+2022 and U+2026, rasterized to
   fixed-size 8-bit alpha bitmap glyph atlases (Rust source data), and renamed
   from "IBM Plex Sans" / "IBM Plex Mono" to "notyas Sans" / "notyas Mono"
   because "Plex" is a Reserved Font Name. No outline, metric, or design data
   was altered before rasterization; advance widths and vertical metrics are
   the font's own values rounded to whole pixels. The atlases remain under OFL
   1.1 (clause 5); the Rust CODE that renders them, like the rest of notyas,
   is GPL-3.0-or-later and is not part of the Font Software.

